# The safety check: a changed token is an internal error (exit 3), and
# nothing is written.
program Opp
arg --damage
arg 1
arg tests/data/fmt-comments.Mod
status 3
output
opp: internal error: tests/data/fmt-comments.Mod: the formatted text, at 4:8: the output has the token Xomments where the input has the token Comments; nothing written
